{"text":{"en":{"스러스트 볼 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"Thrust Ball Bearings | [Company Name] Bearing","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Single Row Thrust Ball Bearings</p> <h2>스러스트 볼 베어링</h2> <p>축과 하우징 시트의 궤도반 사이에 케이지에 조립된 볼이 들어 있으며, 90°의 접촉각이 있어 축방향 하중만을 받을 수 있고 고속회전에는 부적당합니다.</p> <p>평면자리형(51000/29000/900 등)과 조심자리형(53000), 조심자리와셔형(53000U) 등이 공급됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Single Row Thrust Ball Bearings</p> <h2>Thrust Ball Bearings</h2> <p>Balls assembled in a cage sit between the raceway washers on the shaft and housing seat. With a 90° contact angle, they can support only axial loads and are not suitable for high-speed rotation.</p> <p>Available in flat seat type (51000/29000/900, etc.), aligning seat type (53000), and aligning seat washer type (53000U), among others.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">You can search by entering just part of the model number or dimensions.</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/thrust_ball.webp\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · T(높이)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">Our SWS Catalog Standard Drawing</p> <img src=\"img/thrust_ball.webp\" alt=\"Structure cross-section diagram\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(Bore) · D(Outer Diameter) · Tolerance(d/D) · T(Height)</p>","<label for=\"tbaFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"tbaFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: 51205 또는 25*47\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"tbaFilter\">Model / Spec Search</label> <input id=\"tbaFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"e.g. 51205 or 25*47\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"tbaCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"tbaToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"tbaCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"tbaToggleAll\">Expand All</button>","511 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">38건</span>":"Series 511<span class=\"series-count\">38 items</span>","512 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">38건</span>":"Series 512<span class=\"series-count\">38 items</span>","532 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">76건</span>":"Series 532<span class=\"series-count\">76 items</span>","29 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">23건</span>":"Series 29<span class=\"series-count\">23 items</span>","9 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">19건</span>":"Series 9<span class=\"series-count\">19 items</span>","513 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">22건</span>":"Series 513<span class=\"series-count\">22 items</span>","533 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">50건</span>":"Series 533<span class=\"series-count\">50 items</span>","514 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">23건</span>":"Series 514<span class=\"series-count\">23 items</span>","534 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">34건</span>":"Series 534<span class=\"series-count\">34 items</span>","39 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">15건</span>":"Series 39<span class=\"series-count\">15 items</span>","523 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">3건</span>":"Series 523<span class=\"series-count\">3 items</span>","인치 규격<span class=\"series-count\">8건</span>":"Inch Series<span class=\"series-count\">8 items</span>","형번 / 규격 검색":"Model / Spec Search","전체 펼치기":"Expand All"},"ja":{"스러스트 볼 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"スラスト玉軸受 | [会社名] ベアリング","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Single Row Thrust Ball Bearings</p> <h2>스러스트 볼 베어링</h2> <p>축과 하우징 시트의 궤도반 사이에 케이지에 조립된 볼이 들어 있으며, 90°의 접촉각이 있어 축방향 하중만을 받을 수 있고 고속회전에는 부적당합니다.</p> <p>평면자리형(51000/29000/900 등)과 조심자리형(53000), 조심자리와셔형(53000U) 등이 공급됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Single Row Thrust Ball Bearings</p> <h2>スラスト玉軸受</h2> <p>軸とハウジングの座金の軌道盤の間にケージに組み込まれたボールが入っており、90°の接触角があるためアキシアル荷重のみを受けることができ、高速回転には不向きです。</p> <p>平面座形(51000/29000/900など)と調心座形(53000)、調心座ワッシャー形(53000U)などが供給されます。</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">形番または寸法の一部のみ入力しても検索できます。</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/thrust_ball.webp\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · T(높이)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">当社SWSカタログ規格図面</p> <img src=\"img/thrust_ball.webp\" alt=\"構造断面図\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(内径) ・ D(外径) ・ 公差(d/D) ・ T(高さ)</p>","<label for=\"tbaFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</label> <input id=\"tbaFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"예: 51205 또는 25*47\" autocomplete=\"off\">":"<label for=\"tbaFilter\">形番 / 規格検索</label> <input id=\"tbaFilter\" type=\"text\" placeholder=\"例: 51205 または 25*47\" autocomplete=\"off\">","<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"tbaCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"tbaToggleAll\">전체 펼치기</button>":"<p class=\"finder-tip\" id=\"tbaCount\" style=\"margin: 0;\"></p> <button type=\"button\" class=\"spec-toolbar-btn\" id=\"tbaToggleAll\">すべて展開</button>","511 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">38건</span>":"511シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">38件</span>","512 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">38건</span>":"512シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">38件</span>","532 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">76건</span>":"532シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">76件</span>","29 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">23건</span>":"29シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">23件</span>","9 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">19건</span>":"9シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">19件</span>","513 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">22건</span>":"513シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">22件</span>","533 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">50건</span>":"533シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">50件</span>","514 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">23건</span>":"514シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">23件</span>","534 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">34건</span>":"534シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">34件</span>","39 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">15건</span>":"39シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">15件</span>","523 시리즈<span class=\"series-count\">3건</span>":"523シリーズ<span class=\"series-count\">3件</span>","인치 규격<span class=\"series-count\">8건</span>":"インチ規格<span class=\"series-count\">8件</span>","형번 / 규격 검색":"形番 / 規格検索","전체 펼치기":"すべて展開"},"zh":{"스러스트 볼 베어링 | [회사명] 베어링":"推力球轴承 | [公司名] 轴承","<p class=\"eyebrow\">Single Row Thrust Ball Bearings</p> <h2>스러스트 볼 베어링</h2> <p>축과 하우징 시트의 궤도반 사이에 케이지에 조립된 볼이 들어 있으며, 90°의 접촉각이 있어 축방향 하중만을 받을 수 있고 고속회전에는 부적당합니다.</p> <p>평면자리형(51000/29000/900 등)과 조심자리형(53000), 조심자리와셔형(53000U) 등이 공급됩니다.</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">형번 또는 치수 일부만 입력해도 검색됩니다.</p>":"<p class=\"eyebrow\">Single Row Thrust Ball Bearings</p> <h2>推力球轴承</h2> <p>保持架中装配的滚珠位于轴与壳体座圈的滚道之间,接触角为90°,只能承受轴向载荷,不适合高速旋转。</p> <p>提供平底座型(51000/29000/900等)、调心座型(53000)、调心座垫圈型(53000U)等规格。</p> <p class=\"section-head-tip\">只需输入型号或部分尺寸即可搜索。</p>","<p class=\"diagram-caption\">당사 SWS 카탈로그 규격 도면</p> <img src=\"img/thrust_ball.webp\" alt=\"구조 단면도\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(내경) · D(외경) · 공차(d/D) · T(높이)</p>":"<p class=\"diagram-caption\">本公司SWS样本规格图纸</p> <img src=\"img/thrust_ball.webp\" alt=\"结构剖面图\" style=\"display: block; margin: 0 auto; height: 240px; width: auto; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain; image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;\" loading=\"lazy\"> <p class=\"diagram-legend\">d(内径) · D(外径) · 公差(d/D) · T(高度)</p>","<label for=\"tbaFilter\">형번 / 규격 검색</la